# Throwaway verification harnesses.
# Agents build standalone Vite entry points to exercise a single component in a
# real browser. These are scratch build artifacts, never source — and one of
# them (a temporary single-city store list) was once committed by accident and
# shipped, so they are ignored rather than left to be swept up by `git add -A`.
__*.html
__*.tsx
vite.*.config.mts
!vite.config.ts

